### List reviews
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reviews?page=1&limit=10

### Search reviews
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reviews?q=Aarav

### Get one
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reviews/reviews-1

### Create (admin token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "Diya",
  "target": "Garba Night",
  "stars": 4,
  "comment": "Great experience"
}
